WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:03,750
The better I am, the more I will take advantage of my uncle's mediocrity

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:07,910
My grandma is partial to my brother-in-law, so naturally I fell in love with him at first sight.

3
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:11,000
I haven't been treated well by my grandmother since I was a child.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,160
He's been living a very hard life.

5
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:16,770
It doesn't matter if his grandmother isn't nice to him

6
00:00:16,770 --> 00:00:25,870
I'll be nice to him, miss

7
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:26,870
rest

8
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:27,870
See you tomorrow

9
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:33,660
This relationship is uglier than the ledger
